stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED: command commit
  CREATED --> PROCESSING: durable worker claim
  PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED: authoritative success and journal commit
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: definitive no-capture failure
  PROCESSING --> UNKNOWN: timeout or uncertain response
  UNKNOWN --> SUCCEEDED: reconciled success and journal commit
  UNKNOWN --> FAILED: reconciled definitive failure
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  note right of UNKNOWN
    Retain provider key
    Do not create a new capture
  end note
  note right of SUCCEEDED
    Refunds are separate resources
    Contradictions create incidents
  end note
